  m_text: 'The Standard Unarmed Unit of the GAIA PROTOCOL.


    Capable of <color=#b3fbff>interaction</color>
    with points of interests and objectives.


    This is <color=red>incapable</color>
    of dealing damage against <color=red>Kaijus</color>. Be warned as they are quite
    vulnerable.'
